# network:        TCP 127.0.0.1:35745 (D10, req 17 as amended): Nagle off on every client socket (Grpc.Net: Socket.NoDelay in the connect callback; the core: ak_client_opts.tcp_nagle = 0), READ BACK on the live sockets of the measuring process in each case's setup after one untimed call (getsockopt TCP_NODELAY on every socket to the server; one without it fails the case); the server's TCP listener runs the PINNED server configuration only, so shipped and pinned differ on the client side only (shipped: Grpc.Net DisableDynamicWindowSizing and no window, the core's windows at 0; pinned: 4 MiB windows on both client transports)
